stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>\ndirectly from the definition, and again from the matrix. Check that the\nanswers agree.</li>\n<li>Hence decide whether <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\beta\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6FD TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>β</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is\nnondegenerate.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch14-forms/01-bilinear-forms.html"}